### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3030/books

### Add a new book
POST http://localhost:3030/new-book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Harry Potter",
  "author": "J.K. Rowling",
  "totalPages": 309,
  "pagesRead": 0,
  "startReadingDate": "2026-10-14",
  "lastReadDate": null,
  "status": "Reading"
}

### Get one book
GET http://localhost:3030/books/6acfe0ef202b1d5b3b3a81fd


### Update reading progress
PUT http://localhost:3030/books/6ada5e45f78cc855ac5ba8b1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pagesRead": 100
}


### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:3030/books/6ada5e45f78cc855ac5ba8b1


### Create a review for The Hobbit
POST http://localhost:3030/books/6acfe0ef202b1d5b3b3a81fd/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "reviewText": "The Hobbit is an amazing book! I really enjoyed the adventure and the characters."
}


### Get review for The Hobbit
GET http://localhost:3030/books/6acfe0ef202b1d5b3b3a81fd/reviews
Accept: application/json
